Werewolves
The werewolves must eliminate all townsfolk to win. Each night, the werewolves wake up together and decide on a player to kill by pointing at them. They cannot choose another werewolf. If they do not agree, nobody is killed. There are also some werewolf allies such as the warlock and foxes that work with the wolves, but not wake with them - thus the werewolves won't know their role, nor will they know who the wolves are. They may even be accidentally killed by the wolves. These are all the basic werewolf roles:
Werewolf

Wolf Cub
